		<RichText x="66" y="1128" width="434" height="78" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.7490196078431373">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">冰棺：<span color="#99ffff">24冻</span><span>盾，</span><span color="#ffdfbf">16s</span><span>后解除，并恢复</span><span color="#ffdfbf">15%生命值</span><span>，仅触发一次；击破会使其</span><span color="#ffdfbf">扣除20%生命值</span><span>，同时虚弱</span><span color="#ffdfbf">6s</span><span>。</span><span color="#bfdfff">「星烁反应」</span><span>会使</span><span color="#ffacff">雷</span><span>/</span><span color="#7fffd7">风</span><span>的相应反应消耗比变为</span><span color="#ffdfbf">1:4</span><span>，</span><span color="#ff9999">火</span><span>反应消耗变为为</span><span color="#ffdfbf">1:1</span><span>。<br/></span><span color="#ffbfff">[绝境]</span><span>厚度提升至</span><span color="#99ffff">40冻</span><span>盾。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
